    "name": "City Taxi Mission",
    "steam_appid": 3739040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, earn, and dominate the city streets in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> \u2014 a mission-based taxi driving game with endless fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your yellow cab, pick up passengers, and drop them at their destinations across a bustling 3D city. Every successful fare earns you money to upgrade your fleet and unlock new taxis. Whether you're cruising through downtown traffic or weaving past buses and bikes, each mission challenges your reflexes, timing, and road sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude95 <strong>City Taxi Mission</strong> blends fast-paced arcade driving with the satisfaction of casual progression. Perfect for fans of urban driving games, taxi sims, and short-session gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude96 <strong>Drive and Deliver</strong> \u2013 Pick up and drop off passengers across an open city environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Complete multiple passenger drop missions in each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Unlock new taxis with the money you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udede <strong>Smooth Driving Experience</strong> \u2013 Designed for casual players and driving enthusiasts alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>3D Urban Environment</strong> \u2013 Explore traffic-filled city roads with buses, cars, tucks and pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Achievement System</strong> \u2013 Unlock Steam achievements as you rise through the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Fully offline, no internet required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to rule the roads?</strong><br>Start your engine and take on the challenge in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> \u2014 where every ride counts!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive, earn, and dominate the city streets in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> \u2014 a mission-based taxi driving game with endless fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into your yellow cab, pick up passengers, and drop them at their destinations across a bustling 3D city. Every successful fare earns you money to upgrade your fleet and unlock new taxis. Whether you're cruising through downtown traffic or weaving past buses and bikes, each mission challenges your reflexes, timing, and road sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude95 <strong>City Taxi Mission</strong> blends fast-paced arcade driving with the satisfaction of casual progression. Perfect for fans of urban driving games, taxi sims, and short-session gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude96 <strong>Drive and Deliver</strong> \u2013 Pick up and drop off passengers across an open city environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Mission-Based Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Complete multiple passenger drop missions in each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Unlock new taxis with the money you earn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udede <strong>Smooth Driving Experience</strong> \u2013 Designed for casual players and driving enthusiasts alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>3D Urban Environment</strong> \u2013 Explore traffic-filled city roads with buses, cars, tucks and pedestrians</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Achievement System</strong> \u2013 Unlock Steam achievements as you rise through the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Singleplayer</strong> \u2013 Fully offline, no internet required</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to rule the roads?</strong><br>Start your engine and take on the challenge in <i>City Taxi Mission</i> \u2014 where every ride counts!</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\ude96 Pick up passengers, complete missions, and upgrade your taxi in this fast-paced city driving game. City Taxi Mission is a casual, singleplayer experience built around smooth controls, quick fares, and endless urban action.",
